(URBAN DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY — Tender EE/ELE/72/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This specification covers electrical works for sewage treatment plant including motors) Tj T*
(and panels complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(- ALL EQUIPMENT SHALL BE SUITABLE FOR OPERATION AT AN AMBIENT AIR TEMPERATURE NOT) Tj T*
(EXCEEDING 40 DEG C.) Tj T*
(- The equipment shall be suitable for relative humidity up to 95 percent.) Tj T*
(- Site altitude is 2600 m above MSL.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: MAIN LT PANEL) Tj T*
(- Switchboards shall be designed, manufactured and tested in accordance with IS/IEC) Tj T*
(61439-1:2020 and IS/IEC 61439-2:2020.) Tj T*
(- Panels shall be free standing, totally enclosed, made of 2 MM thick CRCA sheet with) Tj T*
(powder coated finish.) Tj T*
(- The panel shall be suitable for 415 V ± 10 percent, 50Hz, 3 phase 4 wire system.) Tj T*
(- The horizontal busbar shall be high conductivity aluminium alloy of 1600A rating.) Tj T*
(- Short time withstand rating of the switchboard shall be 50 k.A. for 1 s. Enclosure) Tj T*
(protection class for the switchboard shall be IP 54.) Tj T*
(- Internal separation of functional units shall be Form 4.) Tj T*
(- INCOMING BREAKER SHALL BE 1600A FOUR POLE DRAW-OUT ACB AS PER IS/IEC 60947-2:2003 WITH) Tj T*
(MICROPROCESSOR RELEASE.) Tj T*
(- All outgoing MCCBs shall have a rated service breaking capacity of not less than 36) Tj T*
(k.A..) Tj T*
(- Each incomer shall be provided with a digital multifunction meter with RS-485 port.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GUARANTEED TECHNICAL PARTICULARS — LT PANEL) Tj T*
(Rated operational voltage: 415 V) Tj T*
(Busbar current rating: 1600A) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
