() Tj T*
(PART E — DRIVE MOTORS) Tj T*
(- The drive motor shall be a three phase TEFC squirrel cage induction motor as per IS) Tj T*
(325:1996.) Tj T*
(- Motor rating shall be 37 Kw continuous.) Tj T*
(- Motors shall operate satisfactorily on a supply of 415 V ± 10 percent and 50Hz ± 5) Tj T*
(percent.) Tj T*
(- The motor shall be premium efficiency IE3 conforming to IS 12615:2018.) Tj T*
(- Motor enclosure shall be totally enclosed fan cooled with IP 55 protection.) Tj T*
(- Insulation shall be class F and the motor shall be rated for S1 continuous duty.) Tj T*
(- MOTOR SPEED SHALL BE 1500 RPM \(4 POLE\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — LT POWER AND CONTROL CABLES) Tj T*
(- LT power cables shall be XLPE insulated 1.1 kV grade armoured cables with aluminium) Tj T*
(conductors as per IS 7098 \(Part 1\):1988.) Tj T*
(- Size of the incoming feeder cable shall be 3.5 core x 300 Sq.mm.) Tj T*
(- Continuous conductor operating temperature of XLPE cables shall be 90 deg C.) Tj T*
(- Copper control cables of 2.5 Sq.mm shall be PVC insulated heavy duty type as per IS) Tj T*
(1554 \(Part 1\). Cable conductors shall meet the resistance requirements of IS 8130 for) Tj T*
(class 2 conductors.) Tj T*
(- Cables shall be laid directly in ground at a depth of 750 MM with brick protection.) Tj T*
(- Terminations shall be made with brass double compression glands and tinned copper) Tj T*
(lugs.) Tj T*
(- Cable drums shall carry marking of size, type, length and manufacturer's name.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
