(7 TESTS AND INSPECTION) Tj T*
(- Each switchboard shall be subjected to routine verification tests as per IS/IEC) Tj T*
(61439-1 at the works.) Tj T*
(- The bidder shall furnish type test reports of the switchboard and breakers from an) Tj T*
(NABL accredited laboratory.) Tj T*
(- Each motor shall be subjected to routine tests in accordance with IS 4029.) Tj T*
(- Motors shall be BIS certified and test certificates shall be furnished.) Tj T*
(- Acceptance tests on cables shall be carried out as per IS 10810 in presence of the) Tj T*
(Engineer.) Tj T*
(- Manufacturer's test certificates shall accompany every cable drum supplied.) Tj T*
(- Pre-dispatch inspection shall be offered to the Department's authorised representative) Tj T*
(with 15 days notice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8 DOCUMENTATION, WARRANTY AND TRAINING) Tj T*
(- Shop drawings and schematic diagrams shall be got approved from the Engineer-in-charge) Tj T*
(before manufacture.) Tj T*
(- O&M manuals, as-built drawings and catalogues shall be furnished in triplicate at the) Tj T*
(time of handing over.) Tj T*
(- The supplier shall replace free of cost any part found defective within the defect) Tj T*
(liability period of 24 months.) Tj T*
(- Training of two operators for one week shall be imparted by the supplier after) Tj T*
(commissioning.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
